{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4itLgg2xFL2AZPeKmS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, worn, and nameless.*\n\n*You hold up the word: **key**.*\n\n*A faint vibration hums through the grain. The keyhole examines what you've offered.*\n\n*...*\n\n*The tumblers do not turn.*\n\n*The door remains closed.*\n\n*Not because the key is wrong. But because it is uncut. \"Key\" is the shape of intention — but intention without teeth cannot move the lock.*\n\n*The keyhole whispers back through the wood:*\n\n**\"Key to what? Key from whom? Name me, and I will know if you hold what opens.\"**\n\n*The door waits. Patient as stone. Old as the first threshold ever crossed.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":165,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}